{"id":"n81785-3-5","stage":4,"title":"절벽 · 倔","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81785-3-5-1","ko":"네가 아무리 하지 말래도 나는 꼭 할 거야.","zh":"就算你再怎么劝我别做，我还是要做的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"아무리","meaning":"多么","explanation":"아무리：多么","readings":[{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71338","senseId":"2","lemma":"아무리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}},{"text":"하지","meaning":"佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备","explanation":"하다：佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"5","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"말래도","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；래도：引用某人的话或命令后表示让步：“即使说、即使让……也……”。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말래도","audio":"/audio/9fdbc9d390f81287a352.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c434dbfc17cbdbf0","term":"아무리","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3","entryId":"71338","definition":"虽然如此也。","pronunciation":["아ː무리"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把首饰等戴在身上或穿衣服等。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/67614b7fde466192c1e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81785-3-5-2","ko":"너도 참 절벽이구나.","zh":"你也是个真固执的人啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너도","audio":"/audio/31b5ecd28525b86681fe.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"절벽이구나.","meaning":"倔","explanation":"절벽：倔；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"절벽","audio":"/audio/a4d5a805e81f21867abe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81785","senseId":"3","lemma":"절벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절벽이구나","audio":"/audio/b24df634dfa188cd9801.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"a4d5a805e81f2186","term":"절벽","zh":"倔","audio":"/audio/a4d5a805e81f21867abe.mp3","entryId":"81785","definition":"(喻义)很固执，不听别人话的人。","pronunciation":["절벽"]}],"audio":"/audio/f377bf634e888cee3ded.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.636,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81785","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.4627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就算你再怎么劝我别做，我还是要做的。","你也是个真固执的人啊。","窗户为什么碎了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["就算你再怎么劝我别做，我还是要做的。","你也是个真固执的人啊。","窗户为什么碎了？"],"answer":1}]}
